    "filters":{"type":"object","properties":{"position":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"ruleset":{"type":"array","items":{"enum":["gi","nogi"]}},"faixa":{"type":"array","items":{"enum":["branca","azul","roxa","marrom","preta"]}}},"additionalProperties":false}
